<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aludie yr shr drops, no div passed.</title>
<headline>Aludie yr shr drops, no div passed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Feb 28</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		1.98	  vs  2.04</p>
<p>    - attrib		  1.63	  vs  0.75</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  nil	  vs  1.30</p>
<p>    Distrib income	  1.95	  vs  1.71</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.22	  vs  0.27</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.01	  vs  0.17</p>
<p>Retained income</p>
<p>     at beginning of year 1.71	  vs  1.79</p>
<p>    Turnover		  4.72	  vs  4.28</p>
<p>Full name: Aludie Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it had not declared a dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
